  "content": "\n\n<h3>【哔哩哔哩】<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bilibili.com%252fvideo%252fBV1MVv1esEbG%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《天津地铁模组 教程介绍 - MCMTR拓展模组》</a></h3>\n<h3>【YouTube】<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B1wPwJmtjn8&list=PLzxdvYevO_3uSYEuZwEr4ggGilyoL-m0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《天津地铁模组 教程介绍 - Minecraft Transit Railway拓展模组》</a></h3>\n<h1>请阅读！</h1>\n<p><em>请在下载前阅读以下内容并备份您的存档！</em></p>\n<p>天津地铁模组是 Minecraft Transit Railway 的拓展模组，包含现实世界中天津地铁的各种元素。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transit-railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway 4.0.0</a> 必须安装。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/filters-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Filters API</a> 必须安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本模组<strong>不会</strong>针对任何旧版本的 Minecraft 或 MTR 进行更新。源代码已在 GitHub 上公开，您可以自行修改。</p>\n<p><strong>如果您打算将其安装到服务器，请下载 \"SERVER\" 分支。</strong></p>\n<h2>社区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/mEvEjPnVXe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTR Tianjin Metro</a></li>\n<li>QQ群：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqm.qq.com%252fcgi-bin%252fqm%252fqr%253f_wv%253d1027%2526k%253d1hLbL58LjVctNZxbhCVrSeznFoaIlVyF%2526authKey%253d7sawgCeF%252fN8kb0dRKiY7hrOXafuUXKn5kkNwSwvPcjJxGidzG75CeFElmLogNUfo%2526noverify%253d0%2526group_code%253d599166518\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCMTR天津地铁模组</a></li>\n<li>子悦汉化组论坛：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.ziyuesinicization.site%252ft%252ftianjin-metro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天津地铁板块</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>本地化</h2>\n<p>天津地铁模组正在使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.ziyuesinicization.site%252fengage%252ftianjin-metro%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ZiYue Weblate</a> 进行翻译。ZiYue Weblate 是一个自托管的 Weblate 实例，这是一款旨在简化开发者与译者协作的网页翻译工具。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.ziyuesinicization.site%252fengage%252ftianjin-metro%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://weblate.ziyuesinicization.site/widget/tianjin-metro/en_us-json/multi-auto.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://patreon.com/ZiYueWeblate?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fziyuecommentary2020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爱发电</a></h2>",
